  "content": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wNf00fvN/lios-overhauled-villages.png\" alt=\"lios-overhauled-villages\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">歡迎來到<strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong>！這個模組為村莊帶來現代化且充滿活力的全新氛圍。升級的建築結構、互動元素，以及每個村莊圖書館中隱藏的祕密，等待您來發掘，享受沉浸式體驗。<br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FkZp6Lwt/villages.png\" alt=\"villages\" width=\"434\" height=\"55\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>平原村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>針葉林村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>沙漠村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>莽原村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>冰雪凍原村莊</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mrsKQ5m4/compatibility.png\" alt=\"compatibility\" width=\"645\" height=\"55\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>此模組與大多數其他模組相容，且應可與任何村莊附加模組搭配使用。不過，您可能正在尋找專門的相容性支援，可於此處找到！</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">-&gt; <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/lios-universal-village-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Lio's Village Compatibility Datapack</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"display:block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: inherit;\">需要基於資料包的設定？</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        請查看 <strong>LioLoader</strong> 以進行全域資料包/資源包載入。適用於 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong> 上的 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong> 版本。\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px;\">在 Modrinth 上開啟 LioLoader →</div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <br /><br /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3pzCfkM/1.png\" alt=\"平原村莊\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/brDfvmC/2.png\" alt=\"平原村莊全景\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7jY72vN/3.png\" alt=\"平原村莊房屋內部\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zQWZvMn/14.png\" alt=\"針葉林村莊全景\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1sfBMpg/15.png\" alt=\"針葉林村莊側面\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YTqFLmg/7.png\" alt=\"沙漠村莊全景\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/93dX39Q/8.png\" alt=\"沙漠村莊側面\" width=\"947\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gZdLhQy/9.png\" alt=\"沙漠村莊市集\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NKNZ0cn/10.png\" alt=\"沙漠製圖師房屋\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8Nhr8p3/11.png\" alt=\"沙漠圖書館\" width=\"945\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PmkSt9x/4.png\" alt=\"莽原村莊\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wwM2nfT/5.png\" alt=\"莽原村莊側面\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3RSgdJq/6.png\" alt=\"莽原武器匠視角\" width=\"947\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ChwtS36/12.png\" alt=\"雪地村莊全景\" width=\"948\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/09rZWDW/13.png\" alt=\"雪地村莊全景第二版\" width=\"950\" height=\"490\" />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3530fDGj/hidden-secrets-and-easter-eggs.png\" alt=\"hidden-secrets-and-easter-eggs\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>圖書館之謎：</strong>探索村莊圖書館，揭開隱藏祕密並發現精心製作的彩蛋。</li>\n<li><strong>互動發現：</strong>與全新的互動元素互動，這些元素會在發現時觸發特殊事件或提供寶貴獎勵。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/seMy8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cvqfFqD/lovbisect.png\" alt=\"lovbisect\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"> </a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" border=\"0\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\">\n<details>\n<summary>影片</summary>\n<p>-於 17:25 評論-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4GQ9mz_q8ko\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>-於 9:54 評論-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/nFs0BDD85kw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>-於 2:52 評論-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VTaizc8Gsmc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/pGkUmgGcsY\"><br /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\" /><br /></a></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DPxQHNKk/usage.png\" alt=\"usage\" width=\"692\" height=\"48\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p>歡迎在任何 Minecraft 模組包中使用 <strong>Lio's Overhalued Villages</strong>。我們鼓勵您將我們的模組整合到您的自訂模組包中，創造多元且刺激的體驗。無需特別取得許可，盡情享受煥然一新的村莊，以最適合您遊玩風格的方式遊玩吧！</p>",
